# Local runtime data (SQLite DB, api-key/calendar-token/vapid-keys json): gitignored, so CI
# images were never affected - but a locally built image from a dev checkout WOULD bake the
# real dev database in without this line (dotnet publish copies app_data/ into the output;
# verified empirically). Never ship it.
**/app_data
